  "design": {
    "idea": "Shattered Bowsprit Boss Arena: The Figurehead tears off the prow on a giant sliding anchor chain, listing the deck every phase; Ballast Clamp her fluke, bank blue off twin mirrors, and claim Half-Lantern #1 and Pane Rip Tide.",
    "kind": "boss",
    "beat": "ketsu",
    "teaches": "Synthesizes Galleon ship roll, Ballast Clamp tether pinning, Ballast Keg blasts, and blue mirror flanking across 3 escalating phases.",
    "decisions": 10,
    "expert_s": 132,
    "reward": "galleon_done+half_lantern_1+pane_rip_tide+cycle_5",
    "why": "Climax boss of The Drowned Galleon awarding Half-Lantern #1, Pane rip_tide, and setting galleon_done toward The Leviathan.",
